{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57205","headline":"十四科头 运用无碍 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 运用无碍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我今滔滔自在，不羡公王卿宰。\n四时犹若金刚，昔乐今常不改。\n法宝喻於须弥，智慧广於澎湃。\n不爲八风所牵，亦无精进懈怠。\n任性浮沈若颠，散诞踪横自在。\n遮莫刀劒临头，我自安然不采。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}